This mod expands the number of active Flashpoints that will display on the map. 
This has been built to allow the many Flashpoints of the Lore Packs to display on the star map.

Note, this can lead to may flashpoints appearing at once. Should you wish for less Flashpoints to be displayed
change "MaxActiveFlashpoints" in "\Lore_Pack_4SW_FP_Cap\StreamingAssets\data\simGameConstants\SimGameConstants.json"
to a lower number. This can be found at the end of the JSON file.
